        "body": "The next time you browse online marketplaces or walk through a fast-fashion store, use this 3-question filter before taking a trending item to the billing counter: • Question 1: Does this color share my temperature? If you have warm golden undertones, does the garment possess warm yellow-brown undertones, or does it carry a cool, chalky blue-gray base? • Question 2: Does it provide contrast against my skin? Hold the fabric up to your face. Does it define your jawline and make your eyes pop, or does it match your skin depth so closely that your head appears to float? • Question 3: Can this fabric breathe in my city? Is it made from breathable natural fibers (cotton, linen, silk, wool blends), or is it 100% synthetic polyester that will trap heat and sweat within twenty minutes? If an item fails any of these three questions, leave it on the rack—no matter how many influencers are promoting it."
